<template>
 <div class="mutation-backdrop" @keydown.stop @keyup.stop @keydown.esc="closePanel">
  <section ref="dialog" class="mutation-workbench" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="mutation-title" @keydown.tab="trap">
   <header><div class="mutation-title-block"><small>LABORATOIRE / STATION {{ station.roman }}</small><h2 id="mutation-title">{{ panel.unlocked?station.title:'Des notes incompréhensibles' }}</h2></div><div class="mutation-header-actions"><button ref="help" class="mutation-help" :data-corruption-help="station.key" :aria-label="'Aide : '+station.title" aria-haspopup="dialog" :aria-expanded="helpOpen" :disabled="busy" @click="openHelp">?</button><button ref="close" class="mutation-close" :disabled="busy" aria-label="Fermer" @click="closePanel">×</button></div></header>
   <div class="mutation-content">
    <p v-if="!panel.unlocked" class="mutation-locked">{{ panel.message }}</p>
    <template v-else>
     <p class="mutation-intro">{{ help }}</p>
     <div class="mutation-type-picker"><label>Type de la plaque<select v-model="type" data-corruption-type :disabled="busy || !!result" @change="reset"><option v-for="name in types" :key="name" :value="name">{{ typeName(name) }} · {{ stock('dark_plate_'+name.toLowerCase()) }} plaque(s)</option></select></label><span class="mutation-type" :style="typeStyle(type)">{{ typeName(type) }}</span><span v-if="panel.station==='type'" class="mutation-risk">Cristaux ×10</span><span v-if="panel.station==='combat'" class="mutation-risk">50 % de réussite</span></div>
     <section v-if="panel.station==='ability'" class="ability-pool"><button data-corruption-pool-toggle :aria-expanded="poolOpen" @click="poolOpen=!poolOpen">Résultats possibles · {{ (possibleAbilities).length }} talents <span aria-hidden="true">{{ poolOpen?'⌃':'⌄' }}</span></button><div v-if="poolOpen"><p>Chaque talent éligible a la même chance d’être obtenu. Ils proviennent des espèces de type {{ typeName(type) }} présentes dans le jeu, talents cachés compris. Les formes exclusives et les talents sans effet pris en charge sont exclus.</p><p>Exclus de cette fabrication : <b>Coloforce, Force Pure et Garde Mystique</b>.</p><label>Rechercher un talent ou une espèce<input v-model="poolSearch" type="search" data-corruption-pool-search placeholder="Talent, effet, espèce…"></label><ul><li v-for="ability in possibleAbilities" :key="ability.key"><strong>{{ abilityName(ability.ability) }}</strong><span>{{ abilityDescription(ability.ability) }}</span><small>Origines : {{ ability.species.map(s=>s.name).join(', ') }}</small><small>Chance : {{ (100/totalAbilities).toLocaleString('fr',{maximumFractionDigits:2}) }} %</small></li></ul><p v-if="!possibleAbilities.length">Aucun résultat.</p></div></section><template v-if="!result">
      <div class="mutation-build-grid">
